{"ticker":"TPR","updated":"2026-10-30T23:17:32Z","profile":{"longName":"Tapestry, Inc.","shortName":"Tapestry, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Luxury Goods","country":"United States","website":"https://www.tapestry.com","fullTimeEmployees":12600,"marketCap":23076046848,"trailingPE":15.995873,"forwardPE":13.084935,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.8829923,"pegRatio":1.69,"targetMeanPrice":161.15788,"targetHighPrice":211.0,"targetLowPrice":96.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.089,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.76595,"operatingMargins":0.19823,"profitMargins":0.19086,"totalRevenue":8004199936,"beta":1.429,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":164.8,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":93.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.57},"summary":"Tapestry, Inc. provides accessories and lifestyle brand products in North America, Greater China, rest of Asia, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Coach and Kate Spade. It offers handbags, fashion designs, business cases, computer bags, messenger style bags, backpacks, travel bags, and totes; accessories, such as small leather goods which includes mini and micro handbags, money pieces, wristlets, pouches, and cosmetic cases, as well as novelty accessories, including address books, time management and travel accessories, sketchbooks, and portfolios; and belts, key rings, technology accessories, gifting, straps, and charms. The company also provides women's and men's footwear, which casual and dress shoes, boots, sneakers, and sandals; and other products which includes outerwear, ready-to-wear, jewelry, watches, eyewear, fragrance, scarves, hats, gloves, and other products. It offers its products through retail and outlet stores, brand e-commerce sites, and concession shop-in-shops, as well as third-party digital platforms, including marketplaces. The company was formerly known as Coach, Inc. and changed its name to Tapestry, Inc. in October 2017. Tapestry, Inc. was founded in 1941 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","summary_zh":"Tapestry, Inc. 在北美、大中華區、亞洲其他地區和國際上提供配件和生活品牌產品。該公司分為兩個部門：Coach 和 Kate Spade。它提供手提包、時尚設計、商務包、電腦包、斜背包、背包、旅行包和手提包；配飾，例如小型皮革製品，包括迷你和微型手提包、錢幣、腕帶、小袋和化妝盒，以及新奇配飾，包括地址簿、時間管理和旅行配件、素描本和文件夾；以及腰帶、鑰匙圈、科技配件、禮品、肩帶和飾物。該公司還提供男女鞋類，包括休閒鞋和正裝鞋、靴子、運動鞋和涼鞋；及其他產品，包括外套、成衣、珠寶、手錶、眼鏡、香水、圍巾、帽子、手套和其他產品。該公司透過零售店和直銷店、品牌電子商務網站、特許店中店以及第三方數位平台（包括市場）提供產品。該公司前身為 Coach, Inc.，於 2017 年 10 月更名為 Tapestry, Inc.。 Tapestry, Inc. 成立於 1941 年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"奢侈品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":100.16,"h":103.15,"l":99.87,"c":102.79,"v":3423500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":103.0,"h":105.34,"l":102.81,"c":104.43,"v":3190000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":104.7,"h":105.85,"l":103.74,"c":105.82,"v":3150900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":105.73,"h":106.0,"l":102.97,"c":104.18,"v":2489400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":105.67,"h":105.89,"l":102.84,"c":104.82,"v":4096700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":104.82,"h":105.25,"l":102.49,"c":105.18,"v":2909800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":107.03,"h":107.52,"l":101.6,"c":105.3,"v":5118500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":106.83,"h":107.35,"l":105.22,"c":106.87,"v":3860000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":106.06,"h":108.0,"l":105.56,"c":106.47,"v":2940800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":106.27,"h":111.49,"l":106.2,"c":110.17,"v":3415400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":110.16,"h":110.16,"l":107.76,"c":109.5,"v":2885300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":110.07,"h":111.02,"l":108.73,"c":109.88,"v":3127100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":110.61,"h":113.46,"l":110.16,"c":113.3,"v":3006900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":113.53,"h":115.35,"l":112.96,"c":114.19,"v":5658300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":114.17,"h":114.71,"l":112.35,"c":113.88,"v":3408700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":113.92,"h":116.49,"l":113.13,"c":116.14,"v":2711600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":115.88,"h":117.0,"l":113.22,"c":113.42,"v":3279100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":111.62,"h":112.0,"l":106.26,"c":107.8,"v":4191200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":108.25,"h":109.06,"l":107.12,"c":109.05,"v":2221000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":110.5,"h":111.5